  "bio": "Robbyn Banks is a highly skilled tattoo artist who specializes in floral and illustrative styles that truly come to life on the skin. Operating out of Your Flesh Tattoo in Durango, Colorado, Robbyn is renowned for their meticulous attention to detail and ability to translate intricate designs into stunning body art. Clients and enthusiasts appreciate Robbyn's clean and precise technique, which is evident in every piece they create.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nI’m Robbyn. Lady Tattooer. Good time haver. @yourfleshtattoo  est. 1996 🖤 Durango, Colorado⚡️110 w 9th street, down the stairs⚡️ robbynbanx@gmail.com\n\nI’m Robbyn. Lady Tattooer. Good time haver. @yourfleshtattoo  est. 1996 🖤 Durango, Colorado⚡️110 w 9th street, down the stairs⚡️ robbynbanx@gmail.com",
